commit b1ce4dc2b9ef5c7af7227f8a37062765ad3629cb

C03: going to a channel inside a messaging client is a known unsupported effect, not a web destination (UI1659)

«ve a Cotele en Discord» was read by the web-destination reader as navigation to a site of that name. A go-to order whose place is scoped to Discord, WhatsApp, Teams, Telegram, Slack, Skype, Zoom, Signal or Messenger (client_navigation_target) is now a known unsupported effect (client.channel.navigate, no operation walks a client's interface): the web destination yields, the turn closes as a limit and the final says plainly that it cannot move through that application's channels, naming the request.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


